Package: mkits-agent
Version: @VERSION@
Architecture: amd64
Maintainer: MKITS SupportSuite project <https://github.com/MK-ITS/MKITS-SupportSuite/issues>
Installed-Size: @SIZE@
Depends: libc6 (>= 2.28), libx11-6, libxtst6, libxrandr2, libfontconfig1, libice6, libsm6, util-linux, systemd
Section: admin
Priority: optional
Homepage: https://github.com/MK-ITS/MKITS-SupportSuite
Description: MKITS SupportSuite agent (permanent remote maintenance)
 Keeps a permanent, end-to-end encrypted connection from this computer to a
 self-hosted MKITS SupportSuite server, so that authorized technicians can
 open the remote shell and – on X11 desktops – view and control the screen.
 After installing, connect it to a server:
 sudo mkits-agent --install --server https://<host> --token <enrollment token>
